<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Noto Sans SC', padding: '20px 64px', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: '96px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: '31px', fontWeight: 700, color: '#1B3557', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>三件事，每件都能指到具体的店和货</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: '15px', color: '#5F6975', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: '6px' }}>这一页看完就知道问题在哪；后面每一页给出名字、数字和动作。</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: '540px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: '20px' }}><Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F4F6F8', padding: '26px 22px', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: '34px', fontWeight: 700, color: '#A97B28', lineHeight: 1 }}>{'01'}</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: '19px', fontWeight: 700, color: '#1B3557', marginTop: '14px' }}>客人在哪家店</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: '15px', color: '#15181D', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: '12px' }}>{'72.7%'} 的客人，进了成交最差的{'4'} 家店，只换回{'30.5%'} 的销售额。</Text><Box style={{ height: '1px', background: '#DDE2E8', marginTop: '18px', marginBottom: '14px' }} /><Text style={{ fontSize: '12.5px', color: '#5F6975', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>盖文全卫定制、Paola Lenti保拉伦蒂、网林全卫定制、科塔全卫定制</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F4F6F8', padding: '26px 22px', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: '34px', fontWeight: 700, color: '#A97B28', lineHeight: 1 }}>{'02'}</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: '19px', fontWeight: 700, color: '#1B3557', marginTop: '14px' }}>货卖不动在哪</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: '15px', color: '#15181D', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: '12px' }}>{'5.3%'} 的商品做出{'80.5%'} 的销售额；访客最多的{'10'} 个洗手盆，吃掉{'61.9%'} 的客人，只做{'5.8%'} 的成交。</Text><Box style={{ height: '1px', background: '#DDE2E8', marginTop: '18px', marginBottom: '14px' }} /><Text style={{ fontSize: '12.5px', color: '#5F6975', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>洗手盆 Top{'3'}：盖文人造石立柱盆、科塔挂墙式洗手盆、网林窄边洗漱盆</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F4F6F8', padding: '26px 22px', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: '34px', fontWeight: 700, color: '#A97B28', lineHeight: 1 }}>{'03'}</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: '19px', fontWeight: 700, color: '#1B3557', marginTop: '14px' }}>钱花在哪</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: '15px', color: '#15181D', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: '12px' }}>{'72'} 个零成交商品，{'18'} 天烧掉{'1.31'}万元，占推广费{'47.6%'}。</Text><Box style={{ height: '1px', background: '#DDE2E8', marginTop: '18px', marginBottom: '14px' }} /><Text style={{ fontSize: '12.5px', color: '#5F6975', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>花钱前三：Nicoline 洞石浴缸、Nicoline 哑光粉浴池、盖文侘寂风立柱盆</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: '40px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: '13px', color: '#5F6975' }}>经营数据诊断{'·'}{'2026-10-20'}</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: '13px', color: '#5F6975' }}>{'02'}{'/'}{'13'}</Text></Box></Slide>
